    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever; appetite returning; sleeping better</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Catheter draining clear urine; no pain, blood, or leakage</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No lightheadedness on standing</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Bowels regular</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

